# "Whenever you attack while creatures you control have total power 8 or greater" is a condition of the trigger event
# (CR 508.3d), not an intervening "if" (CR 603.4): it is judged as Bot1 attacks with Kirk (3) and the Rot-Curse Rakshasa
# (5), and not again as the ability resolves. Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills Kirk in response, leaving 5 power, and the
# ability still exiles the top card of Bot1's library, the Ornithopter.

